  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "E2E Flush / Checkpoint — read from top to bottom",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Growing data → flush scheduling → persistence → checkpoint; separate WP offload path**\n\nSelect a time window containing the workload. Channel filters apply to Milvus channel metrics; log filters apply to WP metrics. They are independent identities: use wpcli metadata to map them; there is no automatic channel-to-log or collection-to-log join. Legends identify the actual process.\n\n**No data ≠ healthy zero.** Lazy/error/remote-only metrics may be absent; `./stack.sh verify` records each stage's coverage. Timers overlap and quantiles are not additive. Read each step's guidance before interpreting an idle signal."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "1. Growing data — buffering and flush pressure",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to use this step",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Start here when writes/consumption succeed but persistence lags. Growing bytes are a gauge, even when a metric ends in _total. Compare pressure with configured watermarks before attributing admission slowdown to WP disk."
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Growing segment bytes",
      "description": "",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "range": true,
          "expr": "sum by (pod,channel_name,lv) (milvus_wal_growing_segment_bytes{cluster=\"$cluster\",namespace=\"$namespace\",woodpecker_id=\"$woodpecker_id\",component=\"streamingnode\",channel_name=~\"${channel:regex}\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}} {{channel_name}} {{lv}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 5,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
