      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to use this step",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Check state before queue latency: an in_recovery flusher may be replaying. Pending tasks include queued AND in-flight work, not just queue length. Dispatcher metrics are version-specific; missing series on another image require a coverage check, not a zero substitution."
